Track 3: The Aftermath of the 8-Track
- Story & Context: Decades after the lighthouse went dark, villagers at the Oksfjord base still find shards of broken magnetic ribbon embedded in the permafrost, vibrating whenever the wind hits a specific angle. They tell stories of a phantom broadcast that keeps the harbor safe, a myth fueled by the lingering hum of a machine that no longer exists. "Listen to the ghost of the groove, it remembers what the sea forgot."
